     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hoang,</span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Unfortunately there isn&#39;t an easy way to get the size legend working at the moment. I disabled it because it didn&#39;t always fit on the plot. I should have amended the documentation to reflect that, apologies I will do it in the next release.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">No plans for bar charts either sorry. I don&#39;t get any financial support to keep rworldmap going so it&#39;s difficult to spend much time on it.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">There is a potential ggplot solution in the link below, but posts on stackoverflow seem to suggest that this may not work currently either.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://rgraphgallery.blogspot.co.uk/2013/04/rg-histogram-bar-chart-over-map.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rgraphgallery.blogspot.co.uk/2013/04/rg-histogram-bar-chart-over-map.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494783533000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GceOT3-Qdq4O_c9EecmvU\">http://rgraphgallery.blogspot.co.uk/2013/04/rg-histogram-bar-chart-over-map.html</a></span><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">You mentioned a non-smooth pie border in your jpg, if you save your image as a pdf (or other vector format) you should get a smoother circle.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Best wishes,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Andy  </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Segoe UI, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> </span></font></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
